      "html": "<p class=\"provider-bio\">The UCS Cancer Center is one of our most comprehensive facilities, offering both medical and radiation oncology under one roof. Equipped with advanced imaging technology including the Omni Legend Digital PET/CT scanner, this clinic serves as a hub for diagnostic workups, treatment delivery, and clinical research. Supportive and rehabilitative care services are also available on site.</p>",
